        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Beyond transportation, we anticipate that growth of the satellite constellations market may drive demand for our satellites, satellites buses, and technologies like solar arrays, hosted payload, on‑orbit satellite refueling, on-orbit inspection, on-orbit satellite maintenance, de-orbiting, debris removal, and other satellite-to-satellite service offerings, if we are successful in executing on our business plan, including fully developing and validating our",
        "start_character": 14820,
        "end_character": 15280
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are unable to fully develop, test and validate our technologies, we may be unable to execute on our business plan and realize the following competitive advantages.",
        "start_character": 15953,
        "end_character": 16122
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also offering variants of our Vigoride OSV to government and commercial customers as a traditional bus manufacturer and satellite prime contractor.",
        "start_character": 7571,
        "end_character": 7725
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our ability to compete successfully as a commercial provider of space transportation, communication, and infrastructure services will depend on several factors including our ability to fully develop, test and validate our technology in space, our ability to establish and maintain a lead in technological advancements, the price of our offerings, customer confidence in the reliability of our offerings, and the frequency and availability of our offerings.",
        "start_character": 15485,
        "end_character": 15952
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe these capabilities could allow us to offer a suite of different in-orbit services, such as inspection, refueling, life extension, re-positioning, salvage missions, maintenance and repair, and de-orbiting.",
        "start_character": 12700,
        "end_character": 12915
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We currently plan to offer the following infrastructure services to the space economy:",
        "start_character": 9520,
        "end_character": 9606
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have designed our satellite buses and Orbital Service Vehicles to use this innovative technology, while also implementing a modular design that enables Momentus to incorporate high-thrust chemical thrusters or electric thrusters instead of the MET for missions with different requirements.",
        "start_character": 3630,
        "end_character": 3922
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to provide these services with Orbital Service Vehicles (“OSVs”) that we design and manufacture.",
        "start_character": 4451,
        "end_character": 4555
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide or plan to provide services, including “last mile” satellite transportation, payload‑hosting, on-orbit satellite refueling, on-orbit inspection, on-orbit satellite maintenance, de-orbiting, debris removal, and other satellite‑to-satellite service offerings.",
        "start_character": 3923,
        "end_character": 4191
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Unique technology with patents pending: Over the past several years, we have worked on developing our patent-pending water plasma propulsion technology that we have demonstrated repeatedly in space, and we have designed our vehicles and services to incorporate this technology.",
        "start_character": 16859,
        "end_character": 17137
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, we also plan to design and produce larger vehicles and satellite buses to carry larger payloads to more distant orbits such as GEO.",
        "start_character": 9379,
        "end_character": 9519
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-022291",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-022291-1e5d4d715314b624",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-022291",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To achieve reusability, we need to develop additional technologies that will allow our vehicles to locate and navigate to customer satellites in space, physically connect to them, and perform a variety of robotic operations including fluid transfer.",
        "start_character": 6801,
        "end_character": 7050
